# Explaining the LiveKit Setup in This Project:
# Summary of LiveKit in This Project:
# LiveKit Server (Port 7880): Handles all real-time WebRTC audio/video/screen packet routing.
# Django (Port 8000): Controls permissions, room access, and signs secure tokens.
# React (livekit-client): Manages room connection, publishes your camera/mic, and renders incoming video tracks on the floating Cosmos proximity cards.
